# msw PIP/PBP layouts, one "<hex> <pip|pbp> <name>" per line. The first
# layout of each kind is the default for a bare `msw pip` / `msw pbp`.
# A value can have more than one name.
#
# Values are for VCP E9 on the Dell AW3423DWF. 00 (off) is built in.
# For pbp, the name is the main input's share of the screen, in percent.
21 pip small
22 pip large
24 pbp 50
29 pbp 25
2a pbp 75
2e pbp 67
